The ''' Mobquet Zambi-35 speeder chariot''' was a collapsible [[speeder bike]] manufactured by [[Mobquet Swoops and Speeders]] as a rugged but ultimately disposable mode of transportation. It consisted of two [[steering vane]] outriggers and a simple control yoke, and could be disassembled and put together easily in order to be stored in harsh conditions.<ref name="DRVG">''[[Star Wars: Dawn of Rebellion: The Visual Guide]]''</ref>

